[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16803.27, "timestamp": "04:40:03", "text": "もの。うん。多すぎる。まるで私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16806.47, "timestamp": "04:40:06", "text": "ええと、それは誰にとっても良いことだと思います。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16807.91, "timestamp": "04:40:07", "text": "私にとっても、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16810.15, "timestamp": "04:40:10", "text": "自分で試してみた。好きになればなるほど"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16813.75, "timestamp": "04:40:13", "text": "探求すればするほど、学ぶことが増える。だからそれは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16816.15, "timestamp": "04:40:16", "text": "例えば、あなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16818.47, "timestamp": "04:40:18", "text": "新しいYouTuber。今ならこう言うでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16820.59, "timestamp": "04:40:20", "text": "探索する方が良い"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16823.67, "timestamp": "04:40:23", "text": "あなた自身。 YouTube で学ぶ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16825.708, "timestamp": "04:40:25", "text": "すべての検索"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16828.788, "timestamp": "04:40:28", "text": "ウェブサイトで、その方法がわかります。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16830.868, "timestamp": "04:40:30", "text": "どうすればそれが実現できるのか、といったこと。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16832.788, "timestamp": "04:40:32", "text": "解決策が見つかるでしょう"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16835.07, "timestamp": "04:40:35", "text": "できる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16838.788, "timestamp": "04:40:38", "text": "うーん、そういえば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16841.51, "timestamp": "04:40:41", "text": "初めて見た時の記憶が蘇った"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16844.788, "timestamp": "04:40:44", "text": "あなたのモデルはインスタグラムか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16847.83, "timestamp": "04:40:47", "text": "初めてあなたを見たとき、何かが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16849.75, "timestamp": "04:40:49", "text": "デビュー前だったと思います。わからない。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16852.708, "timestamp": "04:40:52", "text": "でも、本当に嬉しかったんです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16855.03, "timestamp": "04:40:55", "text": "何てことだ。インドのユーチューバーが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16857.99, "timestamp": "04: